{"summary":"Meditative puzzler based on unreal geometry","description":"In Evo Explores you should trust your eyes. If something looks real - it is real! If you don’t see a problem - there is no problem at all.\n\nManipulate impossible surreal structures, explore optical illusions and solve mind blowing puzzles. Evo Explores is not only a puzzle, it has a long story behind - story of Byte planet and its citizens. Solve puzzles to understand why Byte civilisation is about to disappear.\n\nEvo is a space explorer. Every planet he visits is full of quirks. But the Byte planet is unique. Regular physical laws don't work here. Even the gravity is under control of your imagination.\n\nGo ahead and play Evo Explores to save Byte People from extinction!","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/b-R6mh2gMHA?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/S-ZAoe3JzI2QxFxwnID55u3OQfbLBICr2N7CwekDyhtLcRfkbIYeshga6r1woT5Wg3Z8Og5j3AjImxY0kWKhbOg","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bmjj_luGfcHqocL8hjnvn3orQn_bGYi_pecci9wp8K5jz6pesQsb6ZVw4pEKUEyD9UovPuSQqpoQaB417aucOA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PI1BT3NrJlaLkpHkA1AsOq0ZXTGB9xhdVsUeEAg8lKzNQf_pWpzcF6g3ETphaG8imoJ6GM6biHM3kfOe5Em7qw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7wrrMLjm6DicDujA8OJPPbUqYWvITSGgK-OzJin-3OE7hJtIekroPByf17yl2HPTBg8jofZyrTFoNgziBit5hKo","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OXywWOYsrvzl1uriFUbPZIpxX2yQECcdCMTRRGmIFQGQlCdZnu2q1KXrxtm1o2W9-qb32Snj0XL1L4ZiLbLaQQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OyNr4IHrrJBQsCQUB7KnddEIvBgXFMYg6RB2n7rql8rzkqZTs8GLAK4SlhFlUwIUnxbmAJxN67cQehRFnwm5","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/LH6ylbNNRlxiahh3YpIhGdh_qbBfKN3eNfZtb5vMys8bMKO4rOxjKveAV9JdIxfR6yZ8JRQnk6VqwZH1R4uNYQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jw9oS4jXJnMZbSDLhAIjZm-0OGHX5YKyyWdKV3dEKe6IcC0SX-e9o0udFQ3yOLmIUzWSvVoehctl2S2R-XxKQg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/oeLr8_FHIyQxsD-Kt_RXK7ky